<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🚨 CRITICAL: GitHub Sync Status</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
            background: #1a0000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
        header {
            background: #ff4444;
            color: #000;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .alert-section {
            background: rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.15);
            border: 2px solid #ff4444;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .status-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-left: 4px solid;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .status-github {
            border-left-color: #ff4444;
            background: rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.1);
        }
        .status-local {
            border-left-color: #00ff00;
            background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .status-box h3 {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .status-github h3 { color: #ff4444; }
        .status-local h3 { color: #00ff00; }
        code {
            background: #000;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            color: #0f0;
        }
        .checklist {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        .checklist li {
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .checklist li.missing::before {
            content: "✗";
            color: #ff4444;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .checklist li.present::before {
            content: "✓";
            color: #00ff00;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .command-box {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid #00ff00;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        .command-box code {
            display: block;
            color: #00ff00;
            background: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .solution {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.15);
            border: 2px solid #00ff00;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .solution h2 {
            color: #00ff00;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #888;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding-top: 1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #444;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        th, td {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #444;
        }
        th {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
            color: #00ff00;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>🚨 CRITICAL: GitHub Synchronization Issue</h1>
            <p>Repository mismatch detected — Real Go code exists locally but NOT on GitHub</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.8;">Action Required: FORCE PUSH NEEDED</p>
        </header>

        <div class="alert-section">
            <h2 style="color: #ff4444; margin-bottom: 1rem;">⚠️ Problem Summary</h2>
            <p>
                GitHub repository <code>P2P-60-24/p2p-60-24-evo</code> currently contains only:
                <ul style="margin: 1rem 0 0 2rem;">
                    <li>Skeleton README</li>
                    <li>7 .bin files (HTML/text documentation)</li>
                    <li>NO Go code, go.mod, or CI/CD workflows</li>
                    <li>0 actual implementation</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                Local development repository has:
                <ul style="margin: 1rem 0 0 2rem;">
                    <li>✅ 9 complete Go modules (1,529 LOC)</li>
                    <li>✅ go.mod with dependencies</li>
                    <li>✅ 4 CI/CD workflows (.github/workflows/)</li>
                    <li>✅ Full documentation</li>
                    <li>✅ 4 commits ready to push</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="status-box status-github">
            <h3>❌ GitHub Repository (OUTDATED)</h3>
            <ul class="checklist">
                <li class="missing">go.mod</li>
                <li class="missing">cmd/node/main.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/identity/identity.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/transport/transport.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/eventbus/eventbus.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/statestore/statestore.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/moduleloader/loader.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/group/group.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/context/context.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/matching/orchestrator.go</li>
                <li class="missing">pkg/reputation/weighter.go</li>
                <li class="missing">.github/workflows/ (4 YML files)</li>
                <li class="missing">CONTRIBUTING.md</li>
                <li class="missing">Makefile</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="status-box status-local">
            <h3>✅ Local Repository (READY TO PUSH)</h3>
            <ul class="checklist">
                <li class="present">go.mod</li>
                <li class="present">cmd/node/main.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/identity/identity.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/transport/transport.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/eventbus/eventbus.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/statestore/statestore.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/moduleloader/loader.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/group/group.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/context/context.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/matching/orchestrator.go</li>
                <li class="present">pkg/reputation/weighter.go</li>
                <li class="present">.github/workflows/test.yml</li>
                <li class="present">.github/workflows/build.yml</li>
                <li class="present">.github/workflows/lint.yml</li>
                <li class="present">.github/workflows/pr-checks.yml</li>
                <li class="present">CONTRIBUTING.md</li>
                <li class="present">Makefile</li>
                <li class="present">README.md (updated)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="solution">
            <h2>✅ SOLUTION: Force Push Real Code</h2>
            
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                Execute one of these commands to sync GitHub with local code:
            </p>

            <h3 style="color: #00ff00; margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem 0;">Method 1: SSH (Recommended)</h3>
            <div class="command-box">
                <code>cd /home/claude/p2p-60-24-evo</code><br>
                <code>git push -u origin main --force</code>
            </div>

            <h3 style="color: #00ff00; margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem 0;">Method 2: HTTPS with PAT</h3>
            <div class="command-box">
                <code>cd /home/claude/p2p-60-24-evo</code><br>
                <code>git remote set-url origin https://github.com/P2P-60-24/p2p-60-24-evo.git</code><br>
                <code>git push -u origin main --force</code>
            </div>

            <h3 style="color: #00ff00; margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem 0;">Method 3: Automated Script</h3>
            <div class="command-box">
                <code>bash /home/claude/p2p-60-24-evo/PUSH_TO_GITHUB.sh</code>
            </div>

            <h3 style="color: #00ff00; margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem 0;">What This Will Do:</h3>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Action</th>
                    <th>Effect</th>
                    <th>Result</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Force Push (--force)</td>
                    <td>Overwrite GitHub history with local commits</td>
                    <td>GitHub ← Local (4 commits)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Sync Go modules</td>
                    <td>9 packages now on GitHub</td>
                    <td>github.com/P2P-60-24/... accessible</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Activate CI/CD</td>
                    <td>4 GitHub Actions workflows trigger</td>
                    <td>test.yml, build.yml, lint.yml run automatically</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Update docs</td>
                    <td>Real README, CONTRIBUTING, guides</td>
                    <td>Team can read actual status</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="alert-section">
            <h2 style="color: #ffa500; margin-bottom: 1rem;">⏱️ POST-PUSH CHECKLIST</h2>
            <ol style="margin-left: 2rem;">
                <li><strong>Wait 2 minutes</strong> for GitHub Actions to trigger</li>
                <li><strong>Check Actions tab:</strong> https://github.com/P2P-60-24/p2p-60-24-evo/actions</li>
                <li><strong>Verify workflows:</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li>✓ test.yml passes (go test + coverage)</li>
                        <li>✓ build.yml passes (compile binaries)</li>
                        <li>✓ lint.yml passes (code quality)</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li><strong>Create develop branch:</strong> <code>git push origin develop</code></li>
                <li><strong>Set branch protection</strong> in GitHub UI:
                    <ul>
                        <li>main: require PR + CI/CD pass + architect review</li>
                        <li>develop: require PR + CI/CD pass</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li><strong>Assign 5 developers</strong> for Week 1-2 Phase 1 implementation</li>
                <li><strong>Create 5 Issues</strong> for each module (Identity, Transport, EventBus, StateStore, Matching)</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>🚨 URGENT: Execute push command immediately to sync GitHub with real code</p>
            <p>Session 3 Status: Ready for execution | Generated: 2026-09-23</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
